{
  "id": "pv-export",
  "title": "PV export",
  "summary": "The same two devices, with the PV system now permitted to export. Reversing the grid changes its kind rather than its sign: it stops being a source and becomes a sink, which is all it takes to switch on the export channel and its compensation.",
  "shows": [
    "An exporting grid is a sink, not a source with a negative reading.",
    "Export compensation is earned by the sources the export was drawn from.",
    "Zero gross power guards to zero rather than dividing by zero."
